1
00:04:31,428 --> 00:04:37,428
He's L.A. Detective Mason Storm. Three hired assassins left him for
dead. And he's waited seven years to even the score.

2
00:09:02,857 --> 00:09:08,857
Hard to Kill is a action, drama, crime film directed by Bruce Malmuth.

3
00:13:34,285 --> 00:13:40,285
Mason Storm, a 'go it alone' cop, is gunned down at home.

4
00:18:05,714 --> 00:18:11,714
The intruders kill his wife, and think they've
killed both Mason and his son too.

5
00:22:37,142 --> 00:22:43,142
Mason is secretly taken to a hospital where he spends several years in a coma.

6
00:27:08,571 --> 00:27:14,571
His son meanwhile is growing up thinking his father is dead.

7
00:31:40,000 --> 00:31:46,000
When Mason wakes up, everyone is in danger - himself, his son, his best friend,
his nurse - but most of all those who arranged for his death

8
00:36:11,428 --> 00:36:17,428
Mason Storm, played by Steven Seagal.

9
00:40:42,857 --> 00:40:48,857
Andy Stewart, played by Kelly LeBrock.

10
00:45:14,285 --> 00:45:20,285
Senator Vernon Trent, played by William Sadler.

11
00:49:45,714 --> 00:49:51,714
Lt. Kevin O'Malley, played by Frederick Coffin.

12
00:54:17,142 --> 00:54:23,142
Felicia Storm, played by Bonnie Burroughs.

13
00:58:48,571 --> 00:58:54,571
Capt. Dan Hulland, played by Andrew Bloch.

14
01:03:20,000 --> 01:03:26,000
Hard to Kill is a 1990 American vigilante action-thriller film directed by Bruce Malmuth, written by
Steven McKay, and starring Steven Seagal, Kelly LeBrock, William Sadler and Frederick Coffin.

15
01:07:51,428 --> 01:07:57,428
Seagal's second film after Above the Law, he portrays Mason Storm, a detective who falls
into a coma after being shot during a home invasion that killed his wife.

16
01:12:22,857 --> 01:12:28,857
Reawakening seven years later, Storm embarks on a journey to avenge the death of his wife, and expose
the corruption of Senator Vernon Trent, the man who ordered the murder of his family.

17
01:16:54,285 --> 01:17:00,285
The film was released by Warner Bros.

18
01:21:25,714 --> 01:21:31,714
on February 9, 1990, and grossed $75 million worldwide.

19
01:25:57,142 --> 01:26:03,142
The film explores themes of martial arts, coma, training, cop, revenge.

20
01:30:28,571 --> 01:30:34,571
The tone is emotional and intense.
